glycerides (PubMed:15955102, PubMed:17603008). Additionally possesses acylglycerol transacylase and phospholipase A2 activities (PubMed:15364929, PubMed:17603008). Able to catalyze fatty acyl CoA-dependent retinol esterification during epidermal maturation, when pH becomes acidic (PubMed:15955102)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}